# SEO / AEO conventions

**Canonical doc:** `lib/seo/CLAUDE.md`

## Architecture

- Barrel: `lib/seo/index.ts`
- Generators + components: `lib/seo/structured-data.tsx`
- Config: `lib/seo/config.ts` (env-driven)
- Related: `app/sitemap.ts`, `app/robots.ts`, `<SiteStructuredData />` in `(personal)` layout

## Adding structured data to pages

1. Breadcrumbs on interior pages: `<BreadcrumbStructuredData />`
2. Primary schema (`Article`, `Service`, `CreativeWork`, `FAQ`, etc.)
3. Key pages: `<SpeakableWebPage />` or `addSpeakable()` for AEO
4. Test: [Google Rich Results Test](https://search.google.com/test/rich-results)

## Env (client onboarding)

`NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_DESCRIPTION`, social URLs for `sameAs`.

## Sitemap

Includes Sanity `page`, `project`, `legalPage` types — extend `app/sitemap.ts` when adding new document types with URLs.
